  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "• Spectacular sea views in two directions, encompassing Karepiro Bay, Okura Scenic Reserve and the Hauraki Gulf towards Rangitoto Island.\r\n• Luxurious architect-designed residence on an elevated freehold site, positioned on one of the most desirable streets in sought-after Long Bay.\r\n•Generous, light-filled interiors with two spacious living areas for family living and entertaining.\r\n• Designer kitchen with premium Gaggenau appliances, a marble entertainer’s island and a separate scullery with gas hobs.\r\n• Seamless flow to outdoor entertaining areas with breathtaking sea views.\r\n• Five bedrooms, each with a private ensuite, including a luxurious master suite with coastal sea views.\r\n• Exceptional accommodation for families, extended family and overnight guests.\r\n• Close to Long Bay Beach, Regional Park and the cafes, restaurants and amenities of Long Bay Village.\r\n• Convenient access to Albany, motorway connections and Massey University, with a bus stop for Kristin and Pinehurst schools just across the road.\r\n• Enjoy a luxurious, low-maintenance, lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n• Zoned for Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Long Bay's most prestigious streets, this exceptional architectural residence delivers luxury, scale and breathtaking natural beauty in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nSpectacular views unfold in two directions, across Karepiro Bay and the Okura Scenic Reserve, and over the Hauraki Gulf towards Rangitoto Island, creating a breathtaking backdrop for elevated coastal living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern families and effortless entertaining, the home unfolds across generous, light-filled interiors. Spacious living areas upstairs and downstairs offer excellent separation and flexibility, providing inviting spaces for entertaining, relaxation and family time. Thoughtful architectural design makes the most of the elevated setting, framing coastal views from different rooms and angles throughout the home.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the sleek designer kitchen features premium Gaggenau appliances and an impressive marble entertainer’s island, an elegant gathering place for family and guests. Seamlessly connected to the outdoor entertaining area, it captures beautiful sea views, while a separate scullery with gas hobs provides excellent practicality for passionate home chefs and large-scale entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is exceptional, comprising five beautifully proportioned bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite. The luxurious master suite is a private sanctuary, capturing expansive coastal views and offering an extraordinary sense of space, serenity and refinement. This five-ensuite configuration provides outstanding comfort and privacy for every family member, while also making the home perfectly suited to extended families and overnight guests.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal communities, the property is close to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park and the cafes, restaurants and everyday conveniences of Long Bay Village. Albany’s shopping and business precincts, motorway connections, Massey University and prestigious private schools, including Kristin and Pinehurst, are also within easy reach. The property is zoned for Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nCombining magnificent coastal views, impressive proportions, sophisticated design and exceptional family accommodation, this remarkable residence presents a rare opportunity to enjoy a luxurious, low-maintenance, lock-and-leave lifestyle in an outstanding Long Bay location.",
